---

<BaseLayout
  title="选型智库 // 2026 专线机场、物理线路与原生住宅IP科学决策指南 · ANTIGRAVITY"
  description="拒绝盲目试错。反重力实验室基于 15 家主流专线机场实测数据，提供追剧影音、外贸电商、AI 协同与学生平价全场景选型智库矩阵。"
>
  <div class="py-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- 头部导言 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-10">
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-400 border border-blue-500/20 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>// DECISION INTELLIGENCE & SELECTION MATRIX</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          选型智库 · 专线机场与底层架构决策指南
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          结合晚高峰 RTT 抖动要求、原生住宅 IP 纯净度与真实预算门槛，在 15 家主流专线机场中快速定位最符合您业务场景的专属解决方案。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 快捷标签微看板 -->
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono shrink-0">
        <span class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-semibold">
          <span class="pulse-indicator">
            <span class="pulse-indicator-dot"></span>
          </span>
          <span>5 大业务场景对标库</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-700">|</span>
        <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">100% 实测闭环校验</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 👑 实验室全景第一主推：环球梯 (HuanQiuTi) 专属黄金王者展示位 -->
    <div class="mb-10 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-400/80 dark:border-amber-500/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/80 via-white to-amber-100/40 dark:from-slate-900 dark:via-amber-950/20 dark:to-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/10 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- 装饰背景渐变光晕 -->
      <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-400/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-slate-950 mb-3 shadow-xs">
            <span>👑 实验室全景第一首选推荐 · 综合实力总冠军</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span>#1 环球梯 (HuanQiuTi)</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold">闭眼买主力梯</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            4年+老牌稳健运营，纯物理 IPLC/IEPL 端内专线直连。无论日常追剧看 4K、外贸店铺资金合规，还是 AI 大模型毫秒级回包，环球梯都是全网表现最极致、门槛最低的绝对首选！
          </p>
          
          <!-- 核心特性微徽标 -->
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/60 flex items-center space-x-1">
              <span>● 晚高峰 0.00% 丢包</span>
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/60">
              原生双 ISP 住宅出口 (100%纯净)
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-bold border border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-800/60">
              不限设备数并发在线
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/60">
              支持按量不限时永久备用
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 价格与立即直达购买卡片 -->
        <div class="shrink-0 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-800/95 border border-amber-300/80 dark:border-amber-500/40 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between min-w-[280px]">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">
              <span>专属 7 折券代码</span>
              <span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold">立减 30%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-400/40 text-center font-mono font-black text-lg text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 tracking-wider mb-3">
              HQ66
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2">
              <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">¥8.40</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-through">¥12.00</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">/ 月起</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
              日均低至 ¥0.28，超低尝鲜门槛
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-2">
            <a
              href="/go.html?id=hq"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer"
              class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-amber-600 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs font-mono hover:brightness-110 transition shadow-md shadow-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5"
            >
              <span>⚡ 立即 7 折直达订购环球梯</span>
              <span>→</span>
            </a>
            <a
              href="/posts/iplc-tier1-flagship-review"
              class="w-full py-1.5 text-center block text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400 transition"
            >
              查阅环球梯 72 小时晚高峰压测实录 →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 交互式场景选型推荐器 (Interactive Scenario Matcher) -->
    <div class="mb-14 rounded-2xl border border-blue-200/90 dark:border-blue-900/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50/50 via-white to-cyan-50/30 dark:from-slate-900 dark:via-slate-900/90 dark:to-blue-950/40 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-blue-600 text-white mb-2">
          <span>INTERACTIVE MATCHER</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          交互式场景选型罗盘：点击您的核心业务诉求
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
          点击下方不同场景标签，系统将实时计算并高亮推荐最匹配的专线机场组合方案
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 场景选择 Tab 按钮 -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-8" id="scenario-selector">
        {scenarioSolutions.map((sc, idx) => (
          <button
            type="button"
            class={`scenario-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border font-mono text-xs font-bold transition-all flex items-center space-x-2 cursor-pointer ${
              idx === 0
                ? 'active bg-blue-600 text-white border-blue-600 shadow-md shadow-blue-500/20'
                : 'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-400'
            }`}
            data-target={sc.id}
          >
            <span class="text-base">{sc.icon}</span>
            <span>{sc.name}</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] opacity-80 font-normal px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10">
              {sc.tag}
            </span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- 场景匹配卡片展示区 -->
      <div id="scenario-cards-container">
        {scenarioSolutions.map((sc, idx) => (
          <div
            id={`scenario-card-${sc.id}`}
            class={`scenario-card flex-col gap-6 ${idx === 0 ? 'flex' : 'hidden'}`}
