                </span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-0.5">
                  {sc.icon} {sc.name} · 选型技术门槛
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 max-w-xl">
                  {sc.description}
